WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:10.143
&gt;&gt; Trey: WELCOME BACK TO THIS

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:11.455
&gt;&gt; Trey: WELCOME BACK TO THIS

00:00:11.456 --> 00:00:13.205
SPECIAL EDITION OF "HANNITY,"

00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:14.633
TODAY PRESIDENT TRUMP TRAVELED

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:16.150
TO NEW YORK CITY TO VISIT HIS

00:00:16.151 --> 00:00:17.840
BROTHER ROBERT WHO WAS

00:00:17.841 --> 00:00:19.570
HOSPITALIZED WITH A SERIOUS

00:00:19.571 --> 00:00:20.048
ILLNESS.

00:00:20.049 --> 00:00:24.936
FOX NEWS IS ALEX HOGAN IS LIVE

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.574
WITH THE LATEST ON THIS.

00:00:26.576 --> 00:00:29.881
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT IS IN

00:00:29.915 --> 00:00:32.561
NEW JERSEY BUT EARLIER TODAY HE

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:34.260
STOPPED HERE ON THE UPPER EAST

00:00:34.294 --> 00:00:35.719
SIDE OF MANHATTAN WHERE HIS

00:00:35.754 --> 00:00:36.550
BROTHER ROBERT WAS HOSPITALIZED,

00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:38.532
THE PRESIDENT MAKING THAT STOP

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:39.838
FOR ABOUT AN HOUR, THE

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.737
WHITE HOUSE NOT ELABORATING ON

00:00:41.771 --> 00:00:43.616
HIS CONDITION BUT SAYING THAT HE

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:45.148
IS SERIOUSLY ILL.

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:47.101
ROBERT IS THE YOUNGEST OF FIVE

00:00:47.102 --> 00:00:48.651
SIBLINGS COME AT A PRESS

00:00:48.652 --> 00:00:50.191
BRIEFING, THE PRESIDENT

00:00:50.192 --> 00:00:51.519
COMMENTING ON THEIR BROTHERLY

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.211
BOND.

00:00:52.212 --> 00:00:54.541
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A WONDERFUL BROTHER,

00:00:54.575 --> 00:00:57.331
WE HAVE A GREAT RELATIONSHIP FOR

00:00:57.332 --> 00:00:58.948
A LONG TIME, FROM DAY ONE.

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:00.452
IT’S A LONG TIME AGO AND HE’S IN

00:01:00.453 --> 00:01:02.516
THE HOSPITAL RIGHT NOW.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:06.562
HOPEFULLY HE WILL BE ALL RIGHT.

00:01:06.564 --> 00:01:09.135
HE’S HAVING A HARD TIME.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:10.762
SPEAK OF THE 72-YEAR-OLD SERVED

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:12.820
AS A FORMER TOP EXECUTIVE WITHIN

00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:13.892
THE TRUMP ORGANIZATION, HE

00:01:13.893 --> 00:01:16.372
MARRIED HIS LONGTIME PARTNER IN

00:01:16.373 --> 00:01:18.043
MARCH AND TWO MONTHS AGO,

00:01:18.045 --> 00:01:20.035
ROBERTS TRUMP FILED TEMPORARY

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:22.292
RESTRAINING ORDER TRYING TO

00:01:22.326 --> 00:01:25.516
BLOCK A TELL-ALL BOOK BY HIS

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.778
NIECE MARY.

00:01:26.779 --> 00:01:29.076
EARLIER THIS YEAR, ROBERT WAS

00:01:29.109 --> 00:01:30.190
HOSPITALIZED FOR ABOUT A WEEK,

